<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners net sellers of South Africa bonds last week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net sellers of South Africa bonds last week.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net sellers of 1.06 billion rand worth of South African bonds last week, latest Bond Exchange of South Africa figures show.</p>
<p>Non-resident transactions (million rand):</p>
<p>				   Week to Nov 1   Year to date</p>
<p>    - purchases		     6,273.82     145,616.42</p>
<p>    - sales			   7,329.18     143,567.08</p>
<p>    - net purchases (sales)    (1,055.36)	2,049.34</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
